<Base title="Totalo">
  <h1>Totalo</h1>
  <p>
    Totalo is a receipt scanner and expense tracker for iPhone, made for Morocco. Photograph a
    ticket and Totalo reads the total, the date and the shop, in French, Arabic or English, then
    keeps a monthly ledger of what you spent. Everything stays on your iPhone: no account, no
    internet connection needed.
  </p>
  <p>
    The free version scans 15 receipts a month and shows ads. Totalo Pro, a one-time purchase,
    removes the limit and the ads and adds CSV and PDF export and custom categories.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6818819122">Totalo on the App Store</a> (coming soon)</li>
    <li><a href="https://elmehdimotaqi-ui.github.io/totalo-privacy/support/">Support</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://elmehdimotaqi-ui.github.io/totalo-privacy/">Privacy policy</a></li>
  </ul>
</Base>
